<title>DUBAI: Kuwaiti crown prince in UAE to visit Sheikh Zaid.</title>
<headline>Kuwaiti crown prince in UAE to visit Sheikh Zaid.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kuwait's Crown Prince and Prime Minister Sheikh Saad al-Abdulla al-Sabah arrived in Abu Dhabi on Monday to wish UAE President Sheikh Zaid bin Sultan al-Nahayan well after recent surgery, the official news agency WAM said.</p>
<p>Sheikh Zaid, 78, returned home to a jubilant welcome on Wednesday after neck surgery in the United States.</p>
